    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but how can \"resistance\" even work when everything is already so far gone? it feels less like resistance and more like just rearranging deck chairs on the titanic. it's hard to find meaning in a \"quiet life\" when the very ground we're standing on is basically doomed. it just feels like there's no point in even being part of the countdown.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
